{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "思っていることあんまり伝えられないというか、伝えたことなかったなみたいなことが凄く多くて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとなく損してる気がして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も言ってもらえてうれしかったこと周りにも伝えていきたいなって思って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういうところいいね、これよかったよ、これ凄く上手だね、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張って伝えてみたんですけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に伝えたいことはなかなか言えなくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすきだよ！とか大切な存在だよとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういうことも伝えたいのに、いつも伝えられなくて後悔します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすきだよって、大切だよって思ってます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつかちゃんと文章に逃げずに口に出して伝えたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログをご覧頂きありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広 島 県 出 身 2 0 歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "向 井 純 葉 ( む か い い と は ) で す"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobkK9bQG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の思い出⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日のために用意したとびっきりかわいいお洋服です　♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イルカショー見たよ( ◜▿◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobKvEyzu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は外に出たら少しだけ涼しい風が吹いて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏も終わりかー、と感じてしまいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑さはまだ残ってるのに、空気だけが先に秋になってる感じ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ夏でいたいから置いていかないでよーって思ってる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とくべつななつだったからね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobs0egYN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分とくべつななつだと思ったのは夏のおかげじゃなくて君のおかげだったし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしかしたらとくべつだったのは君なのかも　♬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobo6iu8F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｶﾜｲｲ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日19:00~は櫻坂のさです⟡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かりんさん、きらさんが来てくださいました‪ෆ‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今気づいた！猫さんコンビですね^._.^\n不思議な空間で面白かったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひお聴き下さい♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月、がんばりすぎずがんばっていこうね　♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは"}], "source": "official"}